      "kind": "note",
      "title": "Read me",
      "summary": "What this demo shows, and where to find it",
      "body": "This demo is a café refit run by a small studio: you, Leah, Tom and Ade. Marta owns the café. Everyone marked (demo) is made up.\n\nIt picks up where the weekend away demo stops, with the tools for bigger jobs:\n\n- **Every Board column**, named for this job: Waiting on someone is Blocked, and Client sign-off is In review.\n- **Iterations**: the work runs in weekly rounds. Week 1 is finished and Week 2 is under way.\n- **Time and billing**: hours logged against tasks, an hourly rate, and Week 1 already invoiced. See the Time report.\n- **Costs, budget and suppliers**: what's paid and what's planned, and who supplies what, in Contacts.\n- **Rules**: things that happen on their own, such as a task moved to Waiting on someone getting high priority. See Project settings › Rules.\n- **Task types and templates**: Site work, Order and Snag, each with its own fields; a new Snag starts from the Snag template.\n- **The Timeline**: tasks that wait with a lag, and a baseline showing how the dates have moved since the plan was agreed.\n- **Status updates and goal check-ins** on the Overview.\n- **Won't do**, **links between tasks**, and the **Matrix** for weighing ideas.\n\nChange anything you like. When you are done, remove the project from its More menu."
    },
    {
      "kind": "brief",
      "title": "Marta's brief",
      "summary": "What the café wants, by when, for how much",
      "body": "**The café:** Harbour Café, 12 Quay Street. Thirty covers, open seven days.\n\n**What Marta wants:** a longer counter with room for a second coffee machine, a new floor, warmer lighting and a fresh coat of paint.\n\n**When:** closed for four weeks; reopening on a Saturday.\n\n**Budget:** {{money:12000}} including labour.",
      "tags": ["client"]
    },
